:"可见，看得到","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"某种结果出来。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/18e211fabd8cf037330a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n90529-1-9-2","ko":"네, 저기 아득한 봉우리가 산의 정상이지요?","zh":"是的，那边那座遥远的山峰就是山顶吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"저기","meaning":"那里，那儿","explanation":"저기：那里，那儿","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}},{"text":"아득한","meaning":"遥远，渺然","explanation":"아득하다：遥远，渺然；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"아득하다","audio":"/audio/9a22e609dc0a516fcc17.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90529","senseId":"1","lemma":"아득하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아득한","audio":"/audio/d1e78feac3fba0764fb6.mp3"}},{"text":"봉우리가","meaning":"山峰","explanation":"봉우리：山峰；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"봉우리","audio":"/audio/24f977533c4378598605.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59339","senseId":"1","lemma":"봉우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봉우리가","audio":"/audio/22d7e8692078514d0a43.mp3"}},{"text":"산의","meaning":"山","explanation":"산：山；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"산","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20954","senseId":"1","lemma":"산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"산의","audio":"/audio/ae36cb01789f042b935f.mp3"}},{"text":"정상이지요?","meaning":"顶峰，山顶","explanation":"정상：顶峰，山顶；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지요：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"정상","au